1 0 0 1 0 0 cm  BT /F1 12 Tf 14.4 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 485.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (Beatriz Echauz | CP_12-CP_23 | 19 October 2026) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 465.2 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (OBJECTIVE) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 452.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (I aim to maximise eight unknown functions with a limited evaluation budget:) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 439.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (one new input per function per round. Inputs have two to eight coordinates. I) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 426.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (observe the returned numerical result but cannot inspect the underlying) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 413.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (function.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 393.2 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (CURRENT EVIDENCE) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 380.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (My dataset contains 175 supplied observations plus 88 evaluations from) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 367.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (eleven completed rounds: 263 evaluated input-output pairs. Function-specific) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 354.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (datasets contain 21 to 51 observations. Eight round-12 queries are prepared) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 341.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (and validated; their outcomes are not yet available.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 321.2 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (HOW MY PROCESS FITS TOGETHER) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 308.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (I validate the cumulative data, compare the latest outputs with the previous) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 295.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (best, and review historical prediction errors. I then fit a separate Gaussian) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 282.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (Process \(GP\) to each function using a Matern kernel and target normalisation.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 262.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (The GP estimates a predicted result and uncertainty. I rank candidate inputs) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 249.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (using UCB = predicted mean + 2 x predictive standard deviation. This) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 236.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (balances promising predictions with opportunities to learn in uncertain) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 223.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (regions.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 203.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (Currently, I compare 100,000 global candidates with 10,000 candidates in) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 190.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (each of two local boxes around the best observation. I validate the selected) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 177.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (coordinates, retain their predictions, and prepare six-decimal strings for) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 164.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (manual portal submission.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 144.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (Only returned evaluations count as results. A high UCB is a reason to test a) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 131.2 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (point, not a guarantee of improvement.) Tj T* ET
 

