1 0 0 1 0 0 cm  BT /F1 12 Tf 14.4 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 540.04 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (FROM A BASELINE TO A DOCUMENTED WORKFLOW) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 527.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (In CP_12, I used GP-UCB with global random candidate search. Subsequent) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 514.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (notebooks compared original and wider kernel bounds, responding to fitted) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 501.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (parameters reaching their limits. A boundary warning motivated investigation) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 488.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (rather than proving a model was wrong.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 468.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (CP_14 added linear and RBF SVM diagnostics. CP_15-CP_17 compared) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 455.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (classification and regression approaches, including linear models and small) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 442.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (neural networks. These experiments helped distinguish predictive checks) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 429.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (from the continuous optimisation objective. The current auxiliary models are) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 416.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (an eight-unit neural network for F5 and linear regression for F7; they do not) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 403.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (supply UCB uncertainty.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 383.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (CP_18 compared Matern smoothness and bound configurations using) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 370.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (cross-validation RMSE. Later notebooks retained the selected configurations) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 357.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (while re-estimating continuous kernel parameters as feedback arrived. Global) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 344.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (and local proposals made the exploration-versus-refinement choice explicit.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 324.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (CP_19 compared simple and structured prompts around supplied candidate) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 311.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (data. Numerical candidate ranking remained in Python. CP_21 strengthened) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 298.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (transparency and documentation; CP_22 added regional distance diagnostics) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 285.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (and an F5 minimum-distance constraint. CP_23 added PCA and reproducible) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 272.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (candidate seeds that vary by function and round.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 252.04 Tm /F2+0 10 Tf 12 TL (WHAT NOW GUIDES MY DECISIONS) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 239.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (I use observed progress, prediction errors, candidate distances and model) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 226.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (disagreement. I preserve negative and near-zero outputs, avoid) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 213.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (double-counting cumulative feedback, and separate completed experiments) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 200.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (from planned changes. No function improved in round 11, reinforcing the) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 187.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (need to examine redundancy and uncertainty rather than equating more data) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 174.04 Tm /F3+0 10 Tf 12 TL (with automatic gains.) Tj T* ET
 

